; Night Patrol: made by Voxcade's composer (tools/compose.py in Voxcade's source)
; from its recipe music/night_patrol.compose.toml (dark, D minor, 108 bpm,
; seed 4). Neither comes with a game: change the song here, by hand.
; Chords from free-midi-chords by Ludovic Drolez (MIT).
;
; A: im bIIM bIIIM bIIM (modal): Dm Eb F Eb
; B: bVIM bVIIm im bIIM (modal): Bb Cm Dm Eb
; Form, 8 bars each: intro A | theme A | theme A | bridge B | bridge B | break A | theme A | turn B
; Variation: most (every fourth bar walks and pushes, the broken chords turn, ghost notes on the hi-hat, later themes answer backwards).

#title Night Patrol
#tempo 108

@lead   square duty=0.5 attack=0.01 decay=0.3 sustain=0.55 release=0.25 lowpass=1600 vibrato=0.012 vibrato_speed=5.5 vibrato_delay=0.2 volume=0.3
